>    \]
> 2. For each sector:
>    \[
>    f_{s}^{(s)} \sim \mathcal{N}(\mu_s, \sigma_s^2)
>    \]
> 3. For each stock i:
>    \[
>    \epsilon_{i}^{(s)} \sim \mathcal{N}(0, \sigma_{\epsilon,i}^2)
>    \]
